140039548", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604317775_1615936143372881_8695898608130711721_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7r_WR1cKmXMQ7kNvwFnkLyc&_nc_oc=AdqfLx2HC5qtLarPWGgndPznb9O1QIxWyUOEtKTBVPVcl1buuvDeOWwmfZwZdylLAjw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPVHGMqd0fbMWVW0_7f-WzUPTt5crkI_90c-mqeKpdfUQ&oe=6ACFA52B"}, {"file_name": "s5_store.png", "id": "1077109164966354", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/595129854_1077109171633020_4228115302213382580_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=P0DbJVg81nsQ7kNvwEDJQyp&_nc_oc=AdpHrpXY-LO3hM_zkLuTtE7W9BoWo7uv2MiOXeoVGP2dOarjpG9ZncoaPgEExxCcHSI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPVvW5ibOXPgS8xEraRBC-blRUV1Od2YRQBtly-FB_4Zw&oe=6ACF9966"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "YT_Thumbnail (1).png", "id": "4340215272932068", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819356_4340215279598734_2578510431670342078_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tazvvfRsMy0Q7kNvwF5onWr&_nc_oc=AdpmQfOJhH6XTNtI4TB2Pqeum59oEpBKjp5QXSqp7Xw-S4JIMPcBcDgTs__WPT_Zwc8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPn_zZSayk8Y1VMXMsXNUzydRrhBoPf0powIl4brLRxcQ&oe=6ACFA0FA"}, "display_name": "Sol Protocol", "keywords": ["Coop", "Scifi", "Space", "multiplayer", "roguelike"], "long_description": "**GATHER YOUR TEAM**\n\nOn board, you have to adapt to the dynamically changing conditions. Want to navigate through an asteroid field? Become a Pilot. Ever dreamt of shooting down foes with your turrets? Gunner is perfect. Or would you rather strategically plan your next move and manage ship\u2019s shielding system? Welcome Captain. Each role has a distinct set of tasks to perform and handy tools to utilize throughout the journey. \n{1702449584648660}\n\n**PLAN YOUR BATTLES**\n\nEnemy spaceships are roaming the deep space, looking to destroy and loot your ship. Use different weapons and strategies to deal with intense randomized encounters and collect your loot afterward. Choose your battles wisely, warping away is sometimes the only way to avoid total annihilation.\n{1395443612036441}\n**GATHER YOUR RESOURCES**\n\nResources are sparse, but vital both for the maintenance of your ship as well as future upgrades. Explore the deepest corners of the cosmos to find abandoned space stations and lost vessels to gather the necessary materials. Be careful, though - enemies are searching for loot too\u2026\n{1416004653960762}\n\n**MAINTAIN YOUR SHIP**\n\nKeeping the ship aloft in space is a ceaseless but very rewarding task for the whole crew. Manually repair damaged components by replacing them with parts you find in the world or on deck. Carefully survey any damage  and use repair spheres to send nanobots outside to the affected parts. \n{943002194968550}\n\n **Join your crew on Discord\ud83d\udc47**\n\n**https://www.sol-protocol.com/discord**\n", "short_description": "EXPLORE THE GALAXY WITH YOUR FRIENDS!\n\nSol Protocol is a dynamic VR co-op roguelike where you team up and physically pilot a spaceship through dangerous, procedurally generated stellar systems. Manage your spaceship inside and out, man the turrets, explore abandoned stations or bases on foot, and make strategic decisions together as you push deeper into the unknown deep space. Communication, trust and improvisation are the keys for survival."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.singularperception.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.singularperception.com/term-conditions", "publisher_name": "Singular Perception", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.singularperception.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "